# Dunit Userspace ABI v0 — syscall-number manifest (SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH).
#
# One line per syscall: <number> <CanonicalName>. This file is authoritative;
# tools/gen_abi.py regenerates the consumers from it and refuses to run if the
# kernel's `enum Syscall` (kernel/src/syscall/mod.rs) disagrees:
#   - userspace/libdunit/src/syscall_numbers.rs   (Rust: SYSCALL_<NAME>)
#   - abi/include/dunit/syscall.h                 (C:    SYS_<NAME>)
# Change a number here, run `python3 tools/gen_abi.py`, commit all outputs.

0	Exit
1	Fork
2	Exec
3	Read
4	Write
5	Open
6	Close
